# Figma MCP ↔ XOrA (current build)

Figma MCP is configured for this repo in `.cursor/mcp.json` (`https://mcp.figma.com/mcp`). Authenticate with **Cursor Settings → Tools & MCP → Connect** next to Figma (OAuth). Cloud agents need the same HTTP server enabled in the Cloud Agents MCP dropdown.

Canonical project (Figma Make):
https://www.figma.com/make/fxlmu6hsXHYOrxO81DdVyn/Replicate-Figma-Prototype-Layout

Pinned in `.cursor/figma.json`:

- `fileKey` `fxlmu6hsXHYOrxO81DdVyn`
- `/make/` file — `get_design_context` uses `nodeId` `0:1` unless the prompt has a more specific `node-id`
- Layout source: Make `src/App.tsx` (1920×1080 virtual canvas)
- `get_metadata` / `get_screenshot` / `use_figma` do not apply to Make files

When a Figma URL is in the prompt, extract `fileKey` and `node-id` (`1-2` → `1:2`). For this Make project, start with `0:1`. Load `/figma-design-to-code` before `get_design_context`. Pass `clientLanguages: kotlin` and `clientFrameworks: Compose`.

## Prototype ↔ Compose

| Make (App.tsx) | Compose |
|---|---|
| 1920×1080 scaled canvas | `XORA_DESIGN_WIDTH` / `XORA_DESIGN_HEIGHT` |
| LT account pill | `component/AccountPill.kt` |
| XMB icon row (toolbox, controller, camera, music, filmstrip, globe) | `XmbFigmaHomeCross.kt` + `xmb_figma_*.xml` |
| Game card + “Recently Played” | Recents plate in `XmbFigmaHomeCross.kt` |
| HOME - PHOTOS | `XoraPhotoViewerPane.kt` |
| Now Playing | `XoraNowPlayingPane.kt` |

Home XMB — current-build numbers (Make `src/App.tsx` adapted into Compose):

- Active tab center **(430, 282)**, contain-fit **178×106**
- Inactive tabs **128×123** on the same 282 center line, pitch **310**
- Column x **430**; focused recents plate **top = 420.5**, 462×248
- Hover title x **715** (plate-right + 54); subtitle gap below the rule **35**
- Neighbour above center **105**, below center **785**, stack gap **63**
- Recents hover copy: **game title** + subtitle **Recently Played**
- Kept vs Make: south-east glyph shadows, `INACTIVE_ALPHA` 0.75, seven-tab order
- Categories: Profiles, Settings, Games, **Photos**, **Videos**, Music, XOrA Network
- Photos / Videos / Music device albums use Folder_Photo / Folder_Video / Folder_Music

Glyphs live in `feature/home/src/main/res/drawable/xmb_figma_*.xml` and `XmbIcons.kt`.

## Workflow

1. Call `get_design_context` with `fileKey` `fxlmu6hsXHYOrxO81DdVyn` and `nodeId` `0:1` before changing layout numbers. Then read Make `src/App.tsx` from the returned resources.
2. Reuse existing Compose panes, tokens (`XoraForegroundShadow`, `XoraFonts`, `#EBEBEB` glyph fill), and vector drawables. Do not invent a parallel icon set.
3. If the prompt has a different `figma.com/design/…` or `figma.com/make/…` URL, use that file instead.
4. Code Connect needs a published library on an Organization/Enterprise plan and a `/design/` file. This Make project is the layout source of truth.
